<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101441" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συστάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>standing together</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν
				ἀμπέλων συστάδες</span> vines <i>planted closely</i>
			(not in exact rows, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στοιχάδες</span>),
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1330b29
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκῇ πεφυτευμένη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυστάδες</span>
			, cf. eund. 
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παστάδες</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1524.33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυστὰς ἡ ἀμπελόφυτος γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					7.146
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συστάδες θαλάσσης, ὀμβρίων
			ὑδάτων</span>, <i>cisterns, reservoirs</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.4.13
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>.</div>
